      "id": "p0171-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In standard Japanese, the informal personal pronoun achishi is a part of some regional dialects, but has generally begun to fall out of use. In Japanese entertainment, achishi is commonly associated with feminine characters with youthful energy. Other fictional characters who use achishi include:",
